    "long_instructions": "**☑️ Do This:**\r\n\r\n- Look at the data given to you in `surgery.csv`.\r\n- Run the program to visualize this data in `matplotlib`. The program is already written for you.\r\n- In your Project Planning Guide, respond to the questions in **Step 3: Visualizing Your Problem**.",
